<title>USA: Caesars Palace president resigns.</title>
<headline>Caesars Palace president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp's Caesars World Inc said on Friday that W. Dan Reichartz, the president of the Caesars Palace Casino Hotel in Las Vegas, has resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Peter Boynton, president and chief executive of Caesars World, will directly oversee the operation of Caesars Palace.</p>
